available on the website as of September. Review of applications begins
on&nbsp;<b>January 15</b> and continues as long as space is available.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Review the&nbsp;</span><a href="http://healthpromotion.asu.edu/programs/wellness/graduate/ms/index.htm"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:blue">program description</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;for general information about the program
and visit our&nbsp;</span><a href="http://healthpromotion.asu.edu/programs/wellness/graduate/faqs/index.htm"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:blue">frequently asked questions</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;page for details on deficiency course
requirements, application processes and student information. Typically students
take 2 years (4 semesters) to complete the program. You can use our&nbsp;</span><a href="https://students.asu.edu/tuition"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
color:blue">cost calculator</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;to
estimate the cost of your attendance, based on current tuition/fees.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Again, thank you for
your interest in the Master of Science in exercise and wellness
program.&nbsp;Please contact me if you have any additional questions.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Calligraphy&quot;;
